[1;56r[53;1H[?25l[?12l[?25h7[2;54r8[54d
[1;56r[53;8H[38;5;208m[1K [39m(B[m   If the -m option is given, the contents of the current home directory will be moved to[?25l[?12l[?25h7[2;54r8[54d
